## Phase 0 — Scaffold routes and embed layout

**Goal:** Placeholder pages at four new routes; embed mode works with `EmbedLayout`.

**Exit criteria:** `npm run dev:media` serves `/upload-dialog`, `/selector`, `/viewer`, `/dialog` with minimal embed chrome when `parentOrigin` is set.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Register routes | `media/frontend/src/app/router.tsx` |
| Stub pages | `media/frontend/src/features/media/pages/UploadDialogPage.tsx`, `SelectorPage.tsx`, `ViewerPage.tsx`, `FullDialogPage.tsx` |
| Reuse embed hooks | Extend `useEmbedMode()` (or equivalent in existing picker/upload pages) for surface-specific query params per [04-media-routes-and-api.md](./04-media-routes-and-api.md) |

**Verify:** `npm run dev:media` — load each route with `?parentOrigin=http://localhost:3000&scope=test&folderPath=/`.

