## Phase 2 — File Upload iframe

**Goal:** Device upload with media-type presets and optional image crop. See [02-media-iframe-components.md#1-file-upload-iframe](./02-media-iframe-components.md#1-file-upload-iframe).

**Exit criteria:** Consumer test page uploads image with `crop=true`; parent receives `webonone:media:uploaded` with `MediaItemDto`.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| `mediaType` preset → `accept` mapping (`image`, `pdf`, `all`) | `UploadDialogPage.tsx` |
| File input + drag-and-drop (mobile-friendly) | Reuse `UploadDropzone.tsx` |
| Wire to `POST /api/v1/media/upload` | Existing media API client |
| `ImageCropDialog` + aspect ratio toolbar (1:1, 1:2, 2:1, 3:2, 4:3, 16:9, free) | `components/ImageCropDialog.tsx` — lazy-load cropper; UI Kit `Button` group |
| postMessage `uploaded` / `cancel` | Existing `useMediaPostMessage()` pattern from picker |

**Verify:** Manual embed test via `buildMediaUploadDialogUrl`; `npm run type-check -w media-root`

